the-lyrics = Lyrics
copy-line = Copy this line
copy-sheet = Copy the whole sheet
seek-to-it = Play from this line
nothing-playing = Nothing playing
play-to-follow = Play a track and its words follow it here.
searching = Looking for lyrics…
searching-more = Each lyric source is asked in turn for this track.
unsourced = No lyric source
unsourced-more = None is configured, so nothing is looked up. Choose one in the settings.
missing = No lyrics found
refused = The lyrics could not be fetched
refused-more = A lyric source was asked and did not answer. The next track asks again.
sidecar-hint = No source had lyrics for this track. The pane also reads an .lrc or .txt beside the file or in a Lyrics folder next to it, and lyrics embedded in its tags.
follow-hint = Follow the track again — a scroll of your own holds the pane where you left it
press-hint = Press any line to jump the transport to the moment it is sung at. A scroll of your own holds the pane where you leave it until Follow puts it back on the track.
earlier-hint = Earlier — the words come a tenth of a second sooner, for a sheet that runs late. Kept for this track.
later-hint = Later — the words come a tenth of a second later, for a sheet that runs early. Kept for this track.
put-back-hint = How far the words are moved, minus for sooner and plus for later. Press to put them back on the sheet's own timing.
